Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:18.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all so peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:22.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's extremely rural, huh? There's nothing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:24.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Has it been that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:30.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't been back home once?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.60,0:00:35.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't come home to a place where you've got no family waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:38.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major, you've heard about \Nour general situation, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:55.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, this is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry! Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.44,0:00:59.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have honored guests!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:11.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.82,0:01:15.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.13,0:01:20.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:05.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How have you been, Den?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.71,0:03:10.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandma Pinako...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:13.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time. \NI need your services again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:17.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:22.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've really done quite a number on yourselves this time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:23.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, a lot has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:26.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet you've gotten so small...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:29.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling small, you Minimum Hag?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you've said it, you pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:31.77,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you bean sprout hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.77,0:03:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Micro-pipsqueak!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.58,0:03:33.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Flea-sized hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.26,0:03:35.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:38.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can you speak \Nthat way to your elder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:41.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, Armstrong, will remedy this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:44.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:46.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't get the joke, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:49.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alex Louis Armstrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:53.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pinako Rockbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:04.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you! Winry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:06.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you?! What the heck did you get so messed up for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief! What were you doing to wreck my very best Automail,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.16,0:04:19.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I put my heart \Nand soul into making?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, it came apart so easily...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:24.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al's busted up beyond recognition too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:27.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys were up to something dangerous, weren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.59,0:04:30.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.10,0:04:32.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pipsqueak,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.56,0:04:34.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you've grown a little taller, \Nhaven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:35.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to say "pipsqueak"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.42,0:04:40.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which means, your leg \Nneeds to be adjusted as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:43.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to build \Na new arm from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:46.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you manage all that \Nin a week or so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:54.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate me. \NI'll have it done in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:57.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.15,0:05:00.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what are you \Nin such a rush for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:03.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd like to get back to Central as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're looking for \Nsomething important there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not anything dangerous, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.19,0:05:11.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:13.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:19.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you guys never make anything but trouble for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:26.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry may complain, but she's still always there for us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:37.65,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,It may just be a spare, but there sure is something different about how Granny makes them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,things haven't changed \Naround here, have they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:45.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.62,0:05:53.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Armstrong-san, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:57.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of lives are \Nthose boys living every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:02.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As rural as we are here, we don't get much information about the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:06.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and those boys haven't \Nsent me one letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:09.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I worry about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.59,0:06:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:17.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,particularly the Fullmetal Alchemist—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.77,0:06:20.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,are well known around Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.92,0:06:25.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As a result, they do sometimes get drawn into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:30.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they are all right. \NThose brothers are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:33.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strong, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:35.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just bear with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.62,0:06:40.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This pain is nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to get back to Central quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:51.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and find that material on the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:55.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true, but why don't you take it easy for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:58.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once we go back there, \Nthings are going to be hard, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:03.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but it still bothers me to just sit around doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.09,0:07:05.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.50,0:07:08.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go pay a visit to Mom's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.53,0:07:13.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Visit her grave, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.13,0:07:17.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're leaving as soon as your Automail is fixed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.47,0:07:19.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:21.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:27.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.49,0:07:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:38.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm finished splitting the firewood, \NMadam Pinako.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.61,0:07:40.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:43.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can take it easy for as long as you're here too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, as a soldier, \Nmy daily training is essential.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.91,0:07:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, I haven't \Nseen Edward around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:54.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said he was going to visit his mother's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.90,0:07:59.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told him that going out \Non his own was dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:00.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.28,0:08:03.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has a first-rate escort \Nalong with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:12.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? Ed! You're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:14.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:17.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Four or five years, isn't it? \NAnd yet you're still so stunted, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:19.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't call me stunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, are you still working \Nas a State-whatever-it's-called?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.41,0:08:24.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:27.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself. \NYou're so stunted, and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:29.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop saying I'm stunted!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? \NYou're just spacing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.13,0:08:44.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm... \NWinry, that girl over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.37,0:08:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean Nellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:56.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we were kids, \Nwe used to play a lot together, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hide-and-seek, \Nand going down to the river...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:01.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.09,0:09:07.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't remember her face...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:12.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. She's changed \Nquite a bit after all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:15.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:28.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:31.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,bring Mom back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to go back, Den?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.38,0:09:56.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that one of those watches?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:59.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm? Yeah. It has some workings that boost your power when transmuting—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:01.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The loving workmanship, the edging...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is truly the work of a craftsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.87,0:10:07.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you set it? \NDo you wind it by hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:09.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or is it self-winding? \NOr could it possibly be—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:11.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beats me. I've never worried about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please! Let me examine it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.68,0:10:15.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding! \NIf I let you have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:18.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know you're going to take it apart to the very last screw!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:21.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After I analyze it, I'll put it back together the way it was! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.69,0:10:27.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way. Get someone else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.47,0:10:35.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well now, I think I'll go chop a year's worth of wood...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bleh! Jeez, you guys are stingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:47.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.50,0:10:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Granny says my arm \Nshould be finished tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.36,0:10:53.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once that's done, \Nthe first thing I'll do is fix you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.73,0:10:55.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.82,0:11:02.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, did I ever have any friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:05.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this, all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.98,0:11:08.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My memory is all hazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.56,0:11:11.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't remember the faces of any of my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.17,0:11:16.36,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Well, you know, your memory is something where, one after another, things pile up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:19.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only natural that things from the past will fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:39.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:42.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been meaning to say to you for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I've been too scared... \Nand I haven't been able to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:48.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:50.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:52.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.60,0:11:57.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah... never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:11:59.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:01.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Young men!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:03.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look at this beautiful night sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.09,0:12:06.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The brilliance of the whole sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:10.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is a blessing from Heaven not visible from the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:16.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a nice place—\Nthis village of Resembool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:19.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To make up for \Nnot having anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.09,0:12:21.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it has many things that the city does not have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.88,0:12:31.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Long ago, we used to gaze at the stars like this a lot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:33.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.32,0:12:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, the moment you've been waiting for, docking time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.90,0:12:45.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the moment when the nerves connect that gets me each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:49.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't complain. You want to \Nhurry back to Central, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:53.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, sure. I'd like to get \Nmy original body back soon
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:55.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and say goodbye to this pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:58.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's too bad. \NWe make a killing on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.45,0:13:01.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's right. You needn't force yourselves to go back to the way you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:04.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The smell of oil, the creak of the artificial muscles,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.81,0:13:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the hum of the bearings... \NIsn't Automail wonderful?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:10.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lousy machine fanatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:12.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that, \Nyou transmutation fanatic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.45,0:13:15.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, here goes. One...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.23,0:13:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,two...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:16.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,three!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.04,0:13:25.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two, move aside! \NWe're going to lay Ed down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no idea the pain is so great when you attach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.19,0:13:37.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even a grown man will scream out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.33,0:13:39.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no small matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:50.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is it? I tried to make the weight of the steel 80% less than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:54.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't have it be so heavy that you don't grow any taller, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.52,0:13:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.61,0:14:00.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go talking about people's heights when they're in such pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:02.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you've still got that much pluck, \Nyou'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.11,0:14:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it all working okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:05.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since it's less heavy, \Nits strength has dropped as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:10.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so make sure you don't do anything reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.37,0:14:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can always replace Automail, but you only have one life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.36,0:14:15.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:21.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a little lightheaded \Nafter working through the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.20,0:14:23.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Winry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.77,0:14:26.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The charge for the rush job \Nwon't be cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:29.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:33.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you okay now, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.12,0:14:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yep! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.64,0:14:36.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's terrific!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.48,0:14:39.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll fix you up right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:42.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are all the \Nfragments of the armor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:46.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, the major and the others were careful to pick them all up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.56,0:14:48.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll be repaired right away?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:50.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You do have to \Nknow the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a seal in there, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:15:00.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That serves as the intermediary \Nbetween Al's soul and the armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:05.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was a close one, huh? If I had been gouged just a little bit deeper...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.29,0:15:08.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what else happens, \Nthat part has to be safeguarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:11.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the critical area that keeps Al tethered, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:13.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like it was \Ndrawn with blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:16.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's my blood. \NI drew it pretty frantically.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:17.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:21.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What amazing brotherly love! Such an incredible bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:24.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could you stand back? You're in my way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.86,0:15:27.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This feels great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.41,0:15:48.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! So, should we do the usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.17,0:15:54.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:56.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our teacher always told us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.32,0:16:00.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that in order to train the mind, you must first train the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.28,0:16:02.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al and I always spar \Nwith each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.66,0:16:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, I've never ever \Nbeaten him once.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.28,0:16:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I will assist you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.22,0:16:12.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.93,0:16:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get crazy \Nand break it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:42.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good grief...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.65,0:16:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're all absorbed in themselves. What a couple of children...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:56.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next up is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:03.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Custom-made articles sure are magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.30,0:17:07.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What polished form! \NWhat curious workmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.74,0:17:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must be incredible on the inside too! \NI'd sure like to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd sure like to take it apart! \NI'd sure like to put it back together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:18.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.94,0:17:21.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hee hee...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.16,0:17:23.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:28.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're too soft! You'll never get any further like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.63,0:17:34.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.65,0:17:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.61,0:17:41.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:47.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? \NIs that all you've got?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:11.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:15.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We got him, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.99,0:18:36.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.03,0:18:41.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I had a look...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.73,0:18:51.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.66,0:18:51.40,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:53.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:56.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the love of...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:59.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't even shown it to Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.89,0:19:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:07.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so sissy of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.81,0:19:10.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,having to carry my \Nadmonition toward myself
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.98,0:19:13.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and my resolve around \Nwith me in this fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:14.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.49,0:19:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.93,0:19:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we don't have any parents, \Nor a house to come home to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:22.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All we can do is move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:27.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?! How come?! \NYou have a home, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:30.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have Grandma \Nand me, don't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.13,0:19:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's crazy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you crying for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:41.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You brothers won't cry yourselves, so I'm crying for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:53.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where could Ed and \Nthe others have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.80,0:20:00.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, they'll be back here in no time. Just wait for them like we always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.93,0:20:12.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This was the entrance... and the living room...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On cold days, we'd put wood in the fireplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:21.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother always skipped \Ncutting the wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whenever we were \Nlate getting home,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.81,0:20:37.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mom would flash a lamp \Nfrom the second-story window.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:40.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was bright, and no matter where \Nwe were playing, once we saw that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:43.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we would hurry home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.58,0:20:45.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to mention it, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:54.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two do have a home, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A home, with a warm family waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.64,0:21:13.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:14.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.56,0:21:44.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boys, come on by and \Neat with us once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.71,0:21:47.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure. We will, before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.04,0:21:49.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Granny, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.28,0:21:51.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for looking after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come back soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:21:58.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.66,0:22:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandma...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.63,0:22:07.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I took a look inside Ed's watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.32,0:22:10.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inside, he engraved...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.56,0:22:16.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the date on which they burned down their house and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.79,0:23:40.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.58,0:23:43.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 18: "Marcoh's Notes"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.56,0:23:46.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The first branch of \Nthe Central Library...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.57,0:23:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the burnt ashes, \Na handful of truth rises.
